ent-ClothingHeadHelmetBase = { ent-ClothingHeadBase }
    .desc = { ent-ClothingHeadBase.desc }
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetArmoredBase = { ent-ClothingHeadHelmetBase }
    .desc = { ent-ClothingHeadHelmetBase.desc }
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetBasic = 安保頭盔 | security helmet
    .desc = 標準安全裝備。可保護頭部免受撞擊，並附有可放下以保護眼睛的護目鏡。 | Standard security gear. Protects the head from impacts, and comes with a visor which can be lowered to protect the eyes.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetMerc = 傭兵頭盔 | mercenary helmet
    .desc = 這款戰鬥頭盔常被傭兵使用，既堅固又輕便，散發著火藥與叢林混合的氣味。 | The combat helmet is commonly used by mercenaries, is strong, light and smells like gunpowder and the jungle.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetSwat = SWAT 頭盔 | SWAT helmet
    .desc = 一款極其堅固的頭盔，常被準軍事部隊使用。這款頭盔頂部醒目地印有 Nanotrasen 的標誌。 | An extremely robust helmet, commonly used by paramilitary forces. This one has the Nanotrasen logo emblazoned on the top.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetSwatSyndicate = SWAT 頭盔 | SWAT helmet
    .desc = 一款極其堅固的頭盔，常被準軍事部隊使用。其表面飾有邪惡的紅黑條紋圖案。 | An extremely robust helmet, commonly used by paramilitary forces. It is adorned in a nefarious red and black stripe pattern.
    .suffix = Syndicate
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetRiot = 輕型防暴頭盔 | light riot helmet
    .desc = 這是一款專為防禦近距離攻擊而設計的頭盔，配有可摺疊的護目鏡。 | It's a helmet specifically designed to protect against close range attacks, it has a foldable visor.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetBombSuit = 防爆服頭盔 | bombsuit helmet
    .desc = 一款專為抵禦炸彈產生的壓力及炸彈可能產生的任何碎片而設計的重型頭盔。 | A heavy helmet designed to withstand the pressure generated by a bomb and any fragments the bomb may produce.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetJanitorBombSuit = 清潔人員防爆服頭盔 | janitorial bombsuit helmet
    .desc = 一款專為抵禦化學反應所引發的爆炸而設計的厚重頭盔。 | A heavy helmet designed to withstand explosions formed from reactions between chemicals.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetCult = 邪教頭盔 | cult helmet
    .desc = 一頂結實、外觀邪惡的邪教頭盔。 | A robust, evil-looking cult helmet.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetSpaceNinja = 太空忍者頭盔 | space ninja helmet
    .desc = 這件看似普通的黑色衣物，其實是一頂極其精緻的奈米編織頭盔。這是忍者標準配備。 | What may appear to be a simple black garment is in fact a highly sophisticated nano-weave helmet. Standard issue ninja gear.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetTemplar = 騎士頭盔 | knight helmet
    .desc = 一款仿照古代騎士樣式設計的裝飾性頭盔。 | Decorative helmet fashioned to resemble the knights of old.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetThunderdome = 雷霆穹頂頭盔 | thunderdome helmet
    .desc = 戰鬥開始吧！ | Let the battle commence!
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetWizardHelm = 巫師頭盔 | wizard helm
    .desc = 一頂外型奇特的頭盔，毫無疑問屬於一位真正的魔法師。 | Strange-looking helmet that most certainly belongs to a real magic user.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetFire = 消防頭盔 | fire helmet
    .desc = Atmos 技術愛好者的最佳夥伴。具備一定的耐熱性，而且看起來很酷。 | An atmos tech's best friend. Provides some heat resistance and looks cool.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetAtmosFire = atmos 消防頭盔 | atmos fire helmet
    .desc = 一款 Atmos 消防頭盔，能讓使用者在任何情況下都保持涼爽。 | An atmos fire helmet, able to keep the user cool in any situation.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetLing = 幾丁質頭盔 | chitinous helmet
    .desc = 一團吞噬一切的甲質盔甲。 | An all-consuming chitinous mass of armor.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetERTLeader = ERT 領隊頭盔 | ERT leader helmet
    .desc = 這是由 NanoTrasen 緊急應變小組組長所佩戴的「大氣環境用頭盔」，飾有藍色亮點。 | An in-atmosphere helmet worn by the leader of a Nanotrasen Emergency Response Team. Has blue highlights.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetERTSecurity = ERT 安全頭盔 | ERT security helmet
    .desc = 這是 NanoTrasen 緊急應變小組安保人員所佩戴的氣壓式頭盔。頭盔上帶有紅色裝飾。 | An in-atmosphere helmet worn by security members of the Nanotrasen Emergency Response Team. Has red highlights.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetERTMedic = ERT 醫療人員頭盔 | ERT medic helmet
    .desc = 這是 NanoTrasen 緊急應變小組醫療人員所配戴的常壓頭盔，帶有白色亮點。 | An in-atmosphere helmet worn by medical members of the Nanotrasen Emergency Response Team. Has white highlights.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetERTEngineer = ERT 工程師安全帽 | ERT engineer helmet
    .desc = 這是一款由 NanoTrasen 緊急應變小組工程人員佩戴的大氣環境用頭盔，配有橘色點綴。 | An in-atmosphere helmet worn by engineering members of the Nanotrasen Emergency Response Team. Has orange highlights.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetERTJanitor = ERT 清潔工安全帽 | ERT janitor helmet
    .desc = 這是 NanoTrasen 緊急應變小組清潔人員所配戴的氣內式頭盔，飾有深紫色點綴。 | An in-atmosphere helmet worn by janitorial members of the Nanotrasen Emergency Response Team. Has dark purple highlights.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetRaid = 辛迪加突襲頭盔 | syndicate raid helmet
    .desc = 一款搭配「黑手黨突襲服」使用的裝甲頭盔。非常時尚。 | An armored helmet for use with the syndicate raid suit. Very stylish.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetBone = 骨製頭盔 | bone helmet
    .desc = 一頂由敵人頭骨製成的酷炫頭盔。 | Cool-looking helmet made of skull of your enemies.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetPodWars = 「鐵甲 II」頭盔 | ironclad II helmet
    .desc = 一頂「鐵甲二型」頭盔，是艙體戰爭的神器。 | An ironclad II helmet, a relic of the pod wars.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetJustice = 正義之盔 | justice helm
    .desc = 先進的安防設備。能保護這座站點免受不法之徒的侵害。 | Advanced security gear. Protects the station from ne'er-do-wells.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetJusticeEmpty = { ent-ClothingHeadHelmetJustice }
    .desc = { ent-ClothingHeadHelmetJustice.desc }
    .suffix = Empty
ent-ActionToggleJusticeHelm = 切換正義頭盔 | Toggle Justice Helm
    .desc = 切換「正義頭盔」的穿戴狀態。 | Toggles the justice helm on and off.
ent-CardHelmet = 紙板製頭盔 | cardboard helmet
    .desc = 一頂用紙板製成的中世紀頭盔。 | A medieval helmet built from cardboard.
